  <header>
    <h1>Santa Fe Homelessness Network</h1>
    <p class="sub">Who works on homelessness in Santa Fe city and county, how they connect, and where reentry and job training fit in. Select an organization to see its documented links.</p>
    <div class="meta" id="meta"></div>
  </header>
  <div class="chips" id="chips" role="group" aria-label="Show or hide groups"></div>
  <div class="legend" aria-label="Line key">
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 34 10"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="34" y2="5" class="edge ces"/></svg>Coordinated entry access point</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 34 10"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="34" y2="5" class="edge fund"/></svg>Funds or contracts</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 34 10"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="34" y2="5" class="edge"/></svg>Named partner or participant</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 34 10"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="34" y2="5" class="edge plan"/></svg>From your project notes</span>
  </div>
  <div class="main">
    <div class="stage"><svg id="net" viewBox="0 0 1240 880" role="img" aria-label="Network diagram of Santa Fe homelessness and reentry organizations"></svg></div>
    <aside id="panel" aria-live="polite"></aside>
  </div>
  <section class="notes" id="notes"></section>
  <section class="foot">
    <h2>Sources</h2>
    <ol id="srclist"></ol>
    <p class="fine">A line means two organizations are named together in a source: partner lists, funder lists, access-point lists or event participation. It does not show a contract amount or how strong the relationship is. Several lists were cut off or gave names without roles, so organizations missing here may still belong. Last checked 6 Oct 2026.</p>
  </section>
</div>
